-- Migration: 0036_classic_dungeon_routes
-- Date:    2026-10-28
-- Purpose: Rebuilds the dungeon routes (playerbot_dungeon_routes) of six classic instances from the navmesh, the same way as
--          Uldaman's in 0035: a chain from the instance entrance through the bosses, a crumb every 20 y of walked path, every
--          crumb-to-crumb leg a clean path inside the 74-polygon cap.
--            43  Wailing Caverns     the old route jumped 190-380 y between crumbs in five places (unreachable from each
--                                    other); the new one runs entrance, Anacondra, Kresh, Cobrahn, Pythas, Skum, then
--                                    on from the Serpentis cliff link (playerbot_nav_links 1) to Serpentis and Verdan.
--            48  Blackfathom Deeps   the old route had 13 crumbs up to 314 y apart. New: entrance, Ghamoo-ra, Gelihast,
--                                    Kelris, Aku'mai. Lady Sarevess' pool is not joined to the rest of the navmesh.
--            189 Scarlet Monastery   had no route. One chain per wing from its entrance: Graveyard (Vishas, Thalnos),
--                                    Library (Loksey, Doan), Armory (Herod), Cathedral (Fairbanks, Mograine, Whitemane).
--            229 Blackrock Spire     the old route jumped up to 390 y. New: Lower Spire (Omokk, Vosh'gajin, Voone,
--                                    Smolderweb, Zigris, Halycon, Wyrmthalak), Upper Spire (Emberseer, Rend, the Beast,
--                                    Drakkisath).
--            309 Zul'Gurub           had no route. Entrance, Jeklik (to the foot of her perch), Venoxis, Mar'li, Mandokir,
--                                    Thekal, Jin'do, Hakkar.
--            329 Stratholme          the old route jumped up to 345 y. New: main gate (Forresten, Willey, Galford, Malor),
--                                    service entrance (Barthilas, Anastari, Nerub'enkan, Maleki, Rivendare).
--          Wings that are not joined to each other follow one another in seq; the route follower skips a crumb it cannot
--          reach, so a wing's crumbs only come into play inside that wing.
-- Reverts: yes (the old rows are in sql/playerbot_shared/playerbot_shared_data.sql before this change).

-- @target: shared

DELETE FROM {SHARED}.playerbot_dungeon_routes WHERE map_id IN (43, 48, 189, 229, 309, 329);







ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE applied_at = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
